{"prefectureId":"42","cities":{"42201":[{"id":"42201:national:4634fb4b6377","cityId":"42201","category":"地域","text":"長崎市には出島跡や長崎新地中華街があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%95%B7%E5%B4%8E%E5%B8%82&oldid=111330255"}],"42202":[{"id":"42202:national:cef7a862c5a0","cityId":"42202","category":"地理・自然","text":"市域西側・南西部・南部で海に面しており、市域東側では佐賀県と県境を接しています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%BD%90%E4%B8%96%E4%BF%9D%E5%B8%82&oldid=110819343"},{"id":"42202:national:0a0818fded05","cityId":"42202","category":"地理・自然","text":"市域中西部の相浦地域や南部の早岐地域にも市街地があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%BD%90%E4%B8%96%E4%BF%9D%E5%B8%82&oldid=110819343"},{"id":"42202:national:66da8cd2489c","cityId":"42202","category":"地域","text":"佐世保市は、長崎県の北部地方にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%BD%90%E4%B8%96%E4%BF%9D%E5%B8%82&oldid=110819343"}],"42203":[{"id":"42203:national:2db271a0c549","cityId":"42203","category":"地域","text":"島原市は、長崎県南東部にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B3%B6%E5%8E%9F%E5%B8%82&oldid=111159423"}],"42204":[{"id":"42204:national:255256ec9fcd","cityId":"42204","category":"文化・名所","text":"「諫早市城山暖地性樹叢」は国指定の天然記念物です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/2756"},{"id":"42204:national:d5f6a69a1482","cityId":"42204","category":"地理・自然","text":"諫早市には本明川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%AB%AB%E6%97%A9%E5%B8%82&oldid=111075097"},{"id":"42204:national:6eeafb8e0ea9","cityId":"42204","category":"地理・自然","text":"諫早市には長田川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%AB%AB%E6%97%A9%E5%B8%82&oldid=111075097"}],"42205":[{"id":"42205:national:f350711bb905","cityId":"42205","category":"地理・自然","text":"大村市には多良山系経ヶ岳があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A7%E6%9D%91%E5%B8%82&oldid=110306489"},{"id":"42205:national:b3d759c9f76e","cityId":"42205","category":"地理・自然","text":"大村市には五家原岳があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A7%E6%9D%91%E5%B8%82&oldid=110306489"}],"42207":[{"id":"42207:national:c16ac6e387fe","cityId":"42207","category":"文化・名所","text":"「阿値賀島」は国指定の天然記念物です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/2774"},{"id":"42207:national:93a46074a58b","cityId":"42207","category":"地理・自然","text":"平戸市には安満岳があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B9%B3%E6%88%B8%E5%B8%82&oldid=111102210"},{"id":"42207:national:c062d6de0333","cityId":"42207","category":"地理・自然","text":"平戸市には屏風岳があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B9%B3%E6%88%B8%E5%B8%82&oldid=111102210"}],"42208":[{"id":"42208:national:0eb0767f4bb1","cityId":"42208","category":"産業","text":"市内には漁港が12か所にあります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%9D%BE%E6%B5%A6%E5%B8%82&oldid=111089986"},{"id":"42208:national:62d569d142a3","cityId":"42208","category":"地域","text":"松浦市は、長崎県の北部、北松浦半島に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%9D%BE%E6%B5%A6%E5%B8%82&oldid=111089986"}],"42209":[{"id":"42209:national:5ce4bec1588e","cityId":"42209","category":"地域","text":"対馬市は、長崎県の対馬に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%AF%BE%E9%A6%AC%E5%B8%82&oldid=111363570"}],"42210":[{"id":"42210:national:524cee01b32b","cityId":"42210","category":"文化・名所","text":"「壱岐古墳群」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/00003625"},{"id":"42210:national:bf680fc2eefd","cityId":"42210","category":"地理・自然","text":"市域全域が壱岐対馬国定公園に指定されています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%A3%B1%E5%B2%90%E5%B8%82&oldid=110801008"}],"42211":[{"id":"42211:national:6cd62bfc8886","cityId":"42211","category":"文化・名所","text":"「石田城五島氏庭園」は国指定の名勝です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/2789"},{"id":"42211:national:41bfc5eb21e0","cityId":"42211","category":"地域","text":"五島市は、長崎県の西部、五島列島の南西部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.p